    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d668-a1">

                <pb facs="0695" n="645" xml:id="pg645"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wike to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Treasury Department</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Office of
                                the Secretary</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-09-29"><hi rendition="#italic">September 29,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith for
                    your information a copy of a circular of this date, relative to the
                    admeasurement of Norwegian vessels, etc.</p>
                <p>It is suggested that the attention of the minister of Norway and Sweden be
                    invited to the action taken by this Department in the matter.</p>
                <p>Respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">S. Wike</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
